<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in October, the Economy Ministry said:</p>
<p>    Food and beverages		  -0.6</p>
<p>    Clothing				 0.1</p>
<p>    Housing				  0.1</p>
<p>    Household goods		     -0.1</p>
<p>    Health				   0.0</p>
<p>    Transport and communications     8.0</p>
<p>    Entertainment			  0.4</p>
<p>    Education				0.0</p>
<p>    Others				  -0.1</p>
<p>    Total				    0.5</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
